BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:420 Reggae Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260420T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260420T200000
UID:260414vMgdprTQREy1OITxDhPFbg
DESCRIPTION:420 REGGAE PARTY at The Lounge at Mercy\n\nMonday\, April 20th
  | 1:00PM – 8:00PM\n\nDAY 4 of 420 = FREE ENTRY • ALL DAY VIBES\n\nGet
  ready to celebrate 420 in true island style at The Lounge at Mercy! We’
 re bringing you a full day of reggae rhythms\, good energy\, and elevated 
 vibes from start to finish.\n\nStep into a laid-back atmosphere filled wit
 h music\, community\, and positive vibrations as we turn up the groove all
  day long.\n\nLIVE MUSIC ALL DAY\n\nWe’re stacking the stage with an inc
 redible lineup of reggae talent:\n\nHeadliner: Garden Groove – Sublime T
 ribute Band\n\nExperience the ultimate tribute to Sublime with Garden Groo
 ve\, delivering all the iconic hits and feel-good SoCal reggae vibes you k
 now and love. Expect a nostalgic\, high-energy set that’ll have everyone
  singing along.\n\nFeaturing:\n\nBobby Tenna – Smooth vocals and soulful
  reggae sounds\n\nKool Vibes Band – Our house Reggae band bringing infec
 tious rhythms and feel-good energy\n\nJah Yzer – Roots-driven reggae wit
 h powerful presence\n\nFrom chill grooves to dance-worthy beats\, the musi
 c keeps flowing all day.\n\nEVENT HIGHLIGHTS\n\n🎶 Live reggae performan
 ces from 1PM–8PM\n\n🌿 30+ Brands\, Food & Craft Vendors in a 420-frie
 ndly celebration & atmosphere\n\n🕺 All-day vibes with music\, community
 \, and culture\n\n🎉 FREE ENTRY – no tickets required!\n\nWhether you'
 re a reggae lover\, a Sublime fan\, or just looking for the perfect way to
  spend 420\, this is the place to be.\n\nPull up\, light up the vibes\, an
 d celebrate with us — ALL DAY\, ALL VIBES. 🌿🎶
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://mercywellness.com/4daysof420
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
