BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Growing Dahlias: Dividing & Planting for Success
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260421T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260421T123000
UID:260401xOb0vOD3wkqaRiM6UMJyRg
DESCRIPTION:**Growing Dahlias: Dividing & Planting for Success**\n\nLearn 
 how to grow healthy\, productive dahlias in your home garden. In this hand
 s-on workshop\, local flower farmer Lisa Templeton of Lisa & Tula Flower F
 arm will guide you through the essentials of planting and dividing dahlia 
 tubers.\n\n**In this workshop you’ll:**\n\n• Learn how dahlias grow an
 d reproduce from tubers\n\n• Practice dividing tubers and identifying vi
 able “eyes”\n\n• Understand planting depth\, spacing\, and support\n
 \n• Explore irrigation\, fertility\, and organic pest management\n\nEach
  participant will take home **five tubers from Lisa’s collection** to pl
 ant and grow in their own garden.\n\nPlease bring snips and gardening glov
 es.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
URL:https://gathersebastopol.com/products/growing-dahlias-dividing-plantin
 g-for-success-tuesday-april-21
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
