 ist Linus Lancaster and Healdsburg High School students. The exhibitio
 n features hand-built ceramics\, watercolor\, and sculptural works created
  from locally sourced clays that reflect the diverse landscapes of the Rus
 sian River Watershed. Guests will have the opportunity to meet the artist
  and enjoy curated seasonal bites and refreshment while exploring the ex
 hibition.  \n\nThe installations\, part of the hotel’s rotating art p
 rogram\, will be on view from April 22 through May 21\, 2026 in the h
 otel lobby. The opening reception is complimentary for all attendees\, 
