 ty Pinot Noir\, featuring a walk-around tasting of wines from over 30 loca
 l vintners. Produced by Sonoma County Vintners in collaboration with somme
 lier Christopher Sawyer\, the event invites guests to sip\, swirl\, and ex
 plore a curated selection of outstanding Pinot Noirs. Attendees will also 
 enjoy a grazing station prepared by Bricoleur Vineyards' culinary team and
  Executive Chef Todd Knoll\, creating a perfect pairing for the evening's 
 tastings. This immersive experience offers wine enthusiasts an opportunity
  to discover the breadth and nuance of Sonoma County Pinot Noir in a relax
 ed and celebratory setting.
