BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Live Music Happy Hour - Collaboration Jazz Band - 4th Thursdays!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260423T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260423T190000
UID:260111w-CDaG80RkWb-jlPhTodCQ
DESCRIPTION:Live jazz & global grooves at Golden Hour with Collaboration J
 azz Band—plus happy hour drinks & tasty food!\n\nGolden Hour with Collab
 oration Jazz Band\n\nJoin us for a perfect summer vibe as the Collaboratio
 n Jazz Band takes the stage at Barrel Proof Lounge for Golden Hour—an ea
 rly evening hang of smooth grooves\, global rhythms\, cold drinks\, and gr
 eat food.\n\n Live Music @ 5PM  Happy Hour pricing from 4–7PM  Free p
 opcorn always  Food truck on-site with delicious eats for sale\n\nThis Au
 gust only — we’re shaking things up! Instead of their usual 4th Thursd
 ay slot\, the band will perform on Thursday\, August 21st.\n\nThe Collabor
 ation Jazz Band brings together four uniquely talented Sonoma County music
 ians from diverse musical backgrounds\, blending jazz\, African\, Brazilia
 n\, pop\, and more into one vibrant sound. It’s a collaboration in every
  sense—dynamic\, fresh\, and always fun.\n\n Featuring: David Scott •
  Randy Quan • Geoff Whyte • Tim Haggerty • special guests sitting in
  each time!\n\nCome early\, grab a seat\, sip something cold\, and let the
  music carry you into the evening.\n\nCheck out **www.barrelprooflounge.c
 om** for all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/live-music-happy-hour-collaboration-jazz-
 band-4th-thursdays-tickets-1514156275179?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:April Mixer & Visitor Guide Reveal
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260423T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260423T190000
UID:260419juix9_j8oUaZknRoVSj7og
DESCRIPTION:Join the Santa Rosa Metro Chamber and Visit Santa Rosa for a s
 pecial evening celebrating the launch of the 2026 Visit Santa Rosa Visitor
  Guide\, produced in partnership with Wanderlust Content Studio. Hosted at
  Dave & Buster’s Santa Rosa\, this mixer will also give attendees the op
 portunity to connect with fellow Chamber members\, tourism partners\, and 
 local business leaders while exploring Dave & Buster’s event spaces and 
 team‑building offerings. Enjoy networking\, small bites\, refreshments\,
  and raffle opportunities while celebrating the partners and businesses he
 lping tell Santa Rosa’s story to visitors. This year’s Visitor Guide s
 howcases the very best of Santa Rosa — from our vibrant arts and culture
  scene to our renowned food\, wine\, and craft beer experiences — inspir
 ing visitors to explore everything our community has to offer. Be among th
 e first to see the new publication and learn how it will help promote Sant
 a Rosa to travelers throughout the region and beyond.
LOCATION:Dave and Buster's
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/2166304370850862/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mercado Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260423T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260423T180000
UID:260419dPcK3RyzKEeJIm33qVnkNQ
DESCRIPTION:Taller de Permisos y Licencias para Vendedores de Mercado Rosa
  Si estás planeando vender en Mercado Rosa\, esto no es algo opcional\, e
 s preparación necesaria. Acompáñanos en esta sesión práctica diseñad
 a para ayudar a los vendedores a entender exactamente qué permisos y lice
 ncias se requieren para operar de manera legal y con confianza en Mercado 
 Rosa. Te guiaremos paso a paso para que no haya sorpresas el día del even
 to. Aprenderás qué permisos aplican según tu tipo de negocio\, cómo so
 licitarlos\, qué documentos necesitas y cómo cumplir con las regulacione
 s locales. También hablaremos de los errores más comunes que retrasan a 
 los vendedores o les impiden participar. Este taller es para vendedores de
  comida\, productos y cualquier persona interesada en participar en Mercad
 o Rosa. Ven listo para obtener respuestas claras y salir con un plan listo
  para ejecutar. Fecha: 13 de abril de 2026 Hora: 6:00 PM Ubicación: B-OSS
  Business One Stop Shop\, 350 E St\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95404
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/957039326699772/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
