BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Urchin Dye A Scarf
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260425T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260425T133000
UID:260420Dm1unjna1UWXYphZNgKalA
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, you’ll help the kelp by dyeing a scarf wi
 th the overpopulation of purple sea urchins!\n\nSea Urchins are incredible
  creatures. However\, due to human impact\, their populations have gone un
 checked\, and they have consumed 95% of the kelp forests in California.\n\
 nIn efforts to help the kelp and honor these magnificent animals\, you’l
 l dye a Climate Beneficial Verified Beanie using urchins from the waters s
 urrounding Sea Ranch.$150 per person.
LOCATION:The Sea Ranch Lodge
URL:https://www.thesearanchlodge.com/programming/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
