  on display all 3 days! On Friday at 6pm join CAB's Taste & Paint Fundrais
 er. Wine donated by Bougetz Cellars\, charcuterie board by Chef Carly Pric
 co sponsored by Costco. No experience needed\, ticket can be found on 
 Eventbrite\, search Napa Valley Painting. Saturday's FREE events start at
  1pm with Rebecca Yerger reflecting on Napa State Hospital history\, follo
 wed by Pro-Inclusion's Positive Poster Project at 2pm.
LOCATION:Napa Women's Clubhouse
URL:http://www.nshcommunityadvisoryboard.org
