BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chris James and the Showdowns
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260425T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260425T000000
UID:2604164KCh3SuWekm41DE8j1ewrg
DESCRIPTION:Chris James engages audiences with heartfelt original songs an
 d reimagined classic covers. Performing regularly throughout the Bay Area 
 and beyond as a solo artist\, as well as with his enduring band: The Showd
 owns\, Chris James captures an authentic roots-rock-country sound that kee
 ps ears happy\, and dance floors busy\, meshing the stylings of Southern R
 ock\, Americana\, Country\, and Blues\, often channeling the influences of
  such musical heroes as: Tom Petty\, The Eagles\, Marshal Tucker\, The Rol
 ling Stones\, and Creedence Clearwater Revival. \n\nThe musical synergy cr
 eated between the group is contagious and transcends the stage. Together t
 hey continue to make lasting rock music memories from the trenches of the 
 grittiest bars and clubs—to festivals\, corporate events\, and everythin
 g in between.\n\nTheir most recent album: Vintage Select is a testament to
  the band's 15 plus years together\, showcasing their songwriting craftsma
 nship and musical depth\, while tipping the musical hat to rock legends of
  the past. An accomplished follow up to their esteemed 2019 release: "Some
 where Out In California."\n\nThe Portland Maine native James has performed
  hundreds of live shows on both coasts as a solo artist\, as well as with 
 The Showdowns. He is also no stranger to the studio\, having put forth a n
 umber of full-length albums over the years that have been played on commer
 cial\, satellite\, and internet radio.   \n\n--"Chris James is a rock star
 .” – Hot Mittens Productions\n\n--"James' style of writing is hard to 
 deny as it rings of the times and life situations we can all relate to. It
 's nice to see an artist and band like the Showdowns hold true to American
 a roots while still giving you a rock and roll kick in the ass!" -Starita 
 \\(Producer - Trevor Hall\, Tribe Called Quest\\)\n\n--"Chris is a great s
 inger-songwriter with an honest approach and down to earth style” - J. B
 owman \\(Lead Guitarist - Michael Franti & Spearhead\\)
LOCATION:Brewsters Beer Garden
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108185029?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
