 nd as “Paul Simon meets Talking Heads”.\n\nAdrian enjoys setting philo
 sophical lyrics to joyful music. His topics may veer a tad dark at times b
 ut the underlying music is uplifting\, giving the listener a richly layere
 d experience. Whether he's telling a story about a skinny-dipping episode 
 gone awry or grappling with some major challenge facing humanity\, his lyr
 ics are infused with equal parts hope\, realism and whimsy.\n\nAdrian West
