BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trash Bash/Earth Day
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260425T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260425T160000
UID:260412455qwUZyH0GybNevSucajQ
DESCRIPTION:Trash Bash\n\nin Partnership with City of Sonoma’s Inaugural
  Earth Day\n\nApril 25 from 11 AM – 4 PM · Free and open to the public\
 n\nThe culmination of Trashion Fashion events season is the free wrap up p
 arty called “Trash Bash” which takes place at the Sonoma Community C
 enter. Attendees will have the rare opportunity to see all of the Trashion
  Runway Show outfits up-close\, as well as meet with and talk to the desig
 ners. The Runway Show winners will be announced\, and a final exciting bi
 d call for the Trashion Barbies & Bags Auction will take place. To complet
 e the efforts of waste management mindfulness\, Trash Bash attendees will 
 be able to visit with Sonoma County waste management organizations\, and s
 hop with local Sonoma County sustainability businesses and upcycling artis
 ts.\n\nSustainability Awards and Winners\n\n2026 Trashion outfits on displ
 ay\n\n2026 Trashion Runway Show winners presented\n\nFinal bidding for Bar
 bies & Bags auction & gallery\n\nEarth Day photo contest winners announced
 \n\nGreen Business of the Year award presented\n\nDon’t Miss these Earth
  Day events\n\nUpcycling Artist vendors\n\nDemonstrations from sustainabil
 ity organizations and businesses\n\nSustainable food and beverage vendors\
 n\nAdditional guest speakers for Earth Day\n\nSponsor Trashion Fashion\n\n
 Now in its 16th season\, Trashion Fashion Sonoma is Northern California’
 s beloved month-long celebration where sustainability meets creativity. Th
 is April\, we’re bringing together artists of all ages to transform disc
 arded materials into stunning runway designs\, gallery exhibits\, and comm
 unity experiences.\n\nIconic Runway Show \\(April 18\\) with 40\\+ wearabl
 e art designs\n\nBarbies & Bags Gallery Show & Silent Auction \\(April 2-2
 5\\)\n\nFree community workshops and programming \\(January-April\\)\n\nEd
 ucational initiatives promoting environmental sustainability\n\nJoin us in
  transforming trash to treasure while inspiring our community to reimagine
  waste and embrace sustainable creativity.\n\nContact mc@sonomacommunityce
 nter.org for more information on how to become a sponsor.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/events/trashion-fashion/#trash-bash
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
