UID:260212QJF3ZTWpw06KhiCtFPsFGQ
DESCRIPTION:LIVE BASS/HIPHOP/DUBSTEP MUSIC\, COSTUME THEME PARTY\n\nStep i
 nto a night where legends rise and mischief reigns. iLLuminous Events team
 s up with Shady Oak Brewery\, Royal Sound & Lighting and Pineapple Visuals
  to bring you an immersive costume theme party celebrating the bold styles
 \, iconic looks\, and unforgettable qualities of Heroes and Villains from 
 every universe.\n\nWhether you channel fearless courage or dark charisma\,
  this is your chance to embody the character that speaks to you. Expect an
  electric atmosphere\, themed vibes\, and a crowd dressed to impress.\n\nA
 bout the LINEUP:\n\nThe Chronicles of Shlump Tour comes to the North Bay w
 ith support from Secret Recipe\, SINGE\, and LaiddBackZach.\n\nWHAT TO EXP
 ECT:\n\nHero & Villain–inspired costumes encouraged. Think comic books\,
  video games\, fairy tales\, and folklore.\n\nA high-energy\, creatively c
 urated experience by iLLuminous Events\n\nCraft beer and great vibes at Sh
 ady Oak Brewery\n\nMusic\, visuals\, and surprises throughout the night
LOCATION:Shady Oak Brewery
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/shlump-the-chronicles-o
 f-shlump-tour-w-secret-recipe-singe-laiddbackzach/18092624/2026-04-25T19
