DESCRIPTION:Let your creativity burn bright and your style get a little…
  higher. Join us inside **The Lounge at Mercy** for a hands-on afternoon o
 f crafting\, chill vibes\, and good company. Bring a friend\, spark your i
 magination\, and make something uniquely you — just be sure to grab your
  ticket to save your spot!\n\nThis month’s Craft & Chill is all about cr
 eating your very own **custom ashtray.** We’ll have a variety of bedazzl
 ing supplies\, and charms so you can design a place for your joints that's
  totally one-of-a-kind. Whether you go bold\, sparkly\, artsy\, or just a
  little extra\, there’s no wrong way to make your masterpiece.\n\nSo rol
 l up your sleeves\, add a little sparkle\, and let the creativity flow. By
  the end of the afternoon\, you’ll leave with a custom ashtray that’s 
 lit\, legit\, and totally you.\n\nSpots are limited — snag your ticket a
 nd come craft\, chill\, and top off your look.\n\nBrought to you by **PAX.
 **\n\n**Date & Time**\n\n**Date:** Sunday\, April 26\, 2026\n\n**Time:** 1
 2:00 - 3:00 PM\n\n**What’s Included**\n\nAll craft supplies\n\nGood vibe
 s\n\nA cannabis-friendly lounge to spark your creativity\n\n**Ticket Tiers
 **\n\n**$15 - EARLY BIRD GA: Craft An Ashtray-** Includes the full Craft &
  Chill experience where you’ll design and bedazzle your own ashtray. All
  supplies provided. Early bird pricing until March 31st!\n\n**$20 - Genera
 l Admission: Craft An Ashtray-** Includes the Craft & Chill session where 
 you’ll customize and bedazzle your own ashtray. All materials and suppli
 es included.\n\n**$25 - Craft An Ashtray + Sesh Starter (Joint) -** Craft 
 your own bedazzled ashtray and enjoy a 1g preroll to kick off your sesh wh
 ile you create.\n\n**$30 - Craft An Ashtray + Sesh Starter (Extract) -** I
 ncludes the ashtray crafting experience plus one concentrate for guests wh
 o want a stronger lift while they craft and chill.\n\n**$30 - Craft An Ash
 tray + Sesh Starter (Flower) -** Craft your ashtray and enjoy 1g of flower
  to elevate the creative session.\n\n**$30 - Craft An Ashtray + Sesh Start
 er (Vape) -** Includes the ashtray crafting session plus an all-in-one vap
 e to enjoy during the event.\n\n**$45 - Craft An Ashtray + Flower Flight -
 ** Includes the ashtray crafting session plus a 3-gram flower tasting flig
 ht (three 1g selections) to explore while you craft and chill.\n\n21+ Only
  | DCC # C12-0000420-LIC
