DESCRIPTION:AWS \\(Art Workshop of Western Sonoma County\\) will be celebr
 ating more than 50 years of its Apple Blossom Art Show & Sale at the Sebas
 topol Center for the Arts\, 282 S High Street\, Sebastopol\, CA the weeken
 d of April 24-26.\n\nThe free artists’ reception is on Friday night\, Ap
 ril 24\, from 7 to 9 pm\, featuring wine\, appetizers\, and live music per
 formed by Copley & Radice.\n\nEntrance to the art show on Saturday from 11
  am to 6 pm\, and Sunday from 11am to 4:30 pm\, is included in the Apple B
 lossom Festival admission. The art show will feature more than 150 origina
 l works of art ranging from rural landscapes to experimental abstracts. Vi
 sitors can buy a raffle ticket for a chance to win an original piece of ar
 t donated by last year’s top award winners\, with proceeds benefiting th
 e Sebastopol Center for the Arts’ children’s programs.
