DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T163000
UID:260412c4fxxLFGqka4BFA87HS1yA
DESCRIPTION:Spring Fling at PEJU returns to the iconic PEJU Province estat
 e in Rutherford on Sunday\, April 26\, 2026\, bringing together PEJU's bel
 oved wines and exciting new releases with Chef Nic's irresistible small bi
 tes and tastes from local artisan purveyors. This year\, the celebration g
 ets a festive twist with a splash of carnival magic — a playful\, colorf
 ul vibe that invites you to sip\, savor\, and explore in true Napa Valley 
 style.  Choose between two perfectly timed sessions — 11:00 AM to 1:00 P
 M or 2:30 PM to 4:30 PM — and spend your Sunday afternoon wandering PEJU
 's stunning grounds\, discovering new vintages\, and connecting with fello
 w wine enthusiasts. The carnival-inspired atmosphere adds an element of wh
 imsy to an already enchanting setting\, making this one of the season's mo
 st anticipated events on the Napa Valley social calendar.  General admissi
 on tickets are $100 per person\, with special pricing available for Club P
 EJU members. Available through Tock — sessions are expected to sell out\
 , so reserve your spot early and make the most of springtime in Napa Valle
 y.
URL:https://www.winecountry.com/event/spring-fling-at-peju/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
