DESCRIPTION:Directed by Amanda Claiborne\n\nSponsored by Dobie Edmunds\, L
 ee Hunt & Joan Meisel\n\nIn this hilarious comedy\, two English Shakespear
 ean actors\, Leo and Jack\, find themselves down on their luck.\n\nBut the
 n\, what luck!  They hear that dear old Florence is about to die and leav
 e her fortune to her two long lost English nephews whom she has never seen
 . For Jack and Leo it is the work of an instant to turn themselves into n
 ephews Max and Steve and grab the cash.  And that’s when the complicati
 ons set in… \n\nRomantic entanglements abound\, as Some Like It Hot mee
 ts Twelfth Night in this screwball comedy filled with bad behavior\, high 
 heels and a world of comedy.
