BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:POM Workshop at Marietta Cellar's Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T120000
UID:260413Gjph8N6b50KV0VufWMncDw
DESCRIPTION:There's something deeply satisfying about making something flu
 ffy\, colorful\, and entirely your own - and Marietta Cellars' downtown He
 aldsburg tasting room is the most delightful place to do it. On Sunday\, A
 pril 26\, join creative instructor Naomi for a POM Workshop: an irresistib
 ly fun introduction to the timeless art of pom pom making\, surrounded by 
 the warmth of one of Sonoma County's most beloved wineries. Using a vibran
 t array of yarns in every imaginable color\, guests will learn to craft po
 m poms of any size - perfect for adorning a keychain\, brightening up a re
 arview mirror\, or decking out a holiday tree \\(and beyond\\). All materi
 als are provided and no prior experience is necessary\, making this a wond
 erful outing for families\, friends\, and crafters of every skill level. E
 xpect laughter\, colorful chaos\, and the joy of taking home something han
 dmade you'll actually love. Priced at $103\, the workshop includes light s
 nacks and a first pour of Marietta wine. It's the perfect Sunday morning s
 pent with great wine\, great company\, and your hands joyfully submerged i
 n a sea of beautiful yarn.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/pom-workshop-at-marietta-cellars-tasting-
 room/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
