DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in learning new crafts? Working on setting 
 and meeting new goals? Meeting other like-minded people and making new fri
 ends? Welcome to the Crafters Society! The Crafters Society is a new\, mon
 thly craft club specifically aimed at adults between the ages of 18-35 who
  are interested in flexing their creative muscles\, setting new goals\, an
 d looking to approach life more mindfully. Each monthly session will inclu
 de a themed craft project\, opportunities to reflect on new and past goals
 \, and time to socialize and meet new people. Join us this month to celebr
 ate spring with your own resin suncatcher! Come join us on this creative a
 dventure! We look forward to meeting you! Registration encouraged\; limite
 d supplies available.
LOCATION:Northwest Santa Rosa Library
URL:https://events.sonomalibrary.org/event/crafters-society-110721
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
