 der of Enolytics\\) for her keynote: "Wine Data Superheroes: A Biography\,
  from Idea to AI and Beyond." Panels: The AB 720 Revolution: Now that the 
 "Estate Tasting Event" permit is active\, how is it actually changing the 
 landscape with perspectives from both Napa and Sonoma counties. Buying Tre
 nds – The Frontline View: Gain perspective from local buyers on consumer
  trends and get the buyers perspective on what's moving off the shelves. G
 et tickets 2026 NBBJ Wine Industry Conference | Press Democrat News Group 
 Wednesday\, April 29\, 2026  Location: Oxford Suites Rohnert Park\, CA Kic
 koff: 7:30 AM \\(Breakfast & Networking\\) | 8:30 AM \\(Program Starts\\)
