BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Farm Trails Spring Tour Pizza Pop-Up at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260502T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260502T150000
UID:260420nR7jyYZ2n0OXXs1sVYl7Gg
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the arrival of spring at Gold Ridge Organic Farms. J
 oin us for a delicious pizza pop-up featuring wood-fired pizzas crafted by
  Chef Seamus McCarthy and team. Take a tour of our orchards on foot or by 
 trolley\, soak in the season’s beauty\, and enjoy tasty bites in our Tus
 can-inspired Farm Shop and tasting room.\n\nOn the Menu (available from 12
 :00-2:30pm or until sold out). Pre-orders recommended.\n\nClassic Margheri
 ta: Double 8 Dairy Fresh Mozzarella\, Bianco DiNapoli Tomatoes\, Parmigian
 o Reggiano\, Basil & Gold Ridge Organic Farms Tuscan Blend Extra Virgin Ol
 ive Oil $22\n\nSonoma Mushroom and Pesto: Basil Pesto\, Double 8 Dairy Fre
 sh Mozzarella\, Marinated KM Mushrooms Melange\, Arugula\, Gold Ridge Appl
 e Balsamic Vinegar\, Parmigiano Reggiano & Gold Ridge Organic Farms Pichol
 ine Blend Extra Virgin Olive Oil (CONTAINS NUTS) $28\n\nSpring Vegetable: 
 Bianco DiNapoli Tomato\, Double 8 Dairy Fresh Mozzarella\, Goat Cheese\, E
 arly Summer Squash\, Spring Peas\, Mint\, Basil\, Gold Ridge Organic Farms
  Minerva Blend Extra Virgin Olive Oil $26\n\nSpring Salad: Mixed Greens & 
 Pickled Sonoma Spring Veggies\, Pepita Crumble & Gold Ridge Organic Farms 
 Vinaigrette $12\n\nAlso available: Refreshing beverages\, Straus ice cream
  drizzled with Apple Cider Syrup.\n\nOrchard Tours: Join Farmer Brooke Haz
 en on a guided tour of our olive and apple orchards at 1PM or take a ride 
 through our farm on our apple-themed decorative trolley at 11:30AM\, 12PM\
 , 12:30PM\, 1:30P\n\nFree kids' activities all day long\n\nLive music from
  the Lisa Liu Trio and friends.\n\nMeet other local makers\, including Lan
 i Chan from small-batch sauce brand Hei Ma\, and Mai Nguyen - award-winnin
 g heirloom grain farmer\, miller\, seed keeper\, and community organizer b
 ased right here in Sebastopol. Don’t miss this chance to celebrate sprin
 g\, taste local flavors\, and explore our orchards during the Sonoma Count
 y Farm Trails Spring Tour.\n\nFREE ENTRY - Reservations only required for 
 pre-order pizzas\, salads and tour tickets.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/gold-ridge-organic-farms/event/605453/farm
