 our community strong - **this event was made for you.** Join Charbay Disti
 llery and the Santa Rosa Fire Department for a **bloody delicious showdown
 **: the **2nd Annual Bloody Mary Challenge**\, where top local restaurants
  battle it out for the title of *Best Bloody Mary in Sonoma County*.\n\nYo
 u’ll sip\, sample\, and vote your way through a **lineup of uniquely cra
 fted Bloody Mary’s**\, each with its own twist—while supporting the fi
 refighters who keep our community safe.\n\n**What to Expect:**\n\nA **Bloo
 dy Mary tasting adventure** from some of the most creative bars & restaura
 nts in the region\n\nA **people’s choice vote** - you decide who takes h
 ome the trophy\n\nA lively\, social atmosphere in the heart of Santa Rosa\
 n\nDelicious brunch vibes from **Grossman’s** and the **historic Hotel L
 a Rose**\n\n**All proceeds** support the **Santa Rosa Fire Fighters Founda
 tion**\, a local nonprofit that assists firefighters and their families in
  times of need
LOCATION:Grossman's Noshery & Bar
