DESCRIPTION:Splitting her time between Napa and Sonoma counties\, Bianca C
 ollins loves to capture scenes or moments that resonate with her. Her oil 
 paintings range from quiet landscapes and moments to accurately capturing 
 the personalities of the animals she meets.
