 ic area next to the London Cottage\, the trail runs past the famous concre
 te silos\, offering views of the vineyard and leading into the pristine hi
 llsides filled with madrone\, Douglas fir\, black oak\, buckeye\, bigleaf 
 maple\, and grassy meadows on the slopes of Sonoma Mountain.
