 d writing songs at a young age after discovering their dad’s old guitar 
 and vinyl collection and being introduced to rock and roll\, blues and cou
 ntry music. Their song ‘We Got Love’ \\(2017\\) brought them national 
 recognition selling out shows across the US and their albums ‘Ghost Talk
 er’ \\(2019\\) and ‘Letters’ \\(2022\\) garnered attention from 'Rol
 ling Stone\,’ 'Billboard' and 'The Boot' calling their music “cinemati
 c\,” “captivating blood harmonies” and "for fans of John Mayer\, Mum
 ford & Sons and Jason Isbell.”
