DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260502T123000
UID:260419RvCmN_3RGU-xh5AArkev8w
DESCRIPTION:Swim with an Olympian at Stanly Ranch\, Auberge Collection —
  Dive into an extraordinary morning at Halehouse\, the luxurious wellness 
 sanctuary at Stanly Ranch in Napa\, where five-time Olympic gold medalist 
 Nathan Adrian shares the training and recovery techniques that forged his 
 legendary career. This exclusive experience combines hands-on swim instruc
 tion with insights from one of America's greatest aquatic athletes\, set a
 gainst the serene backdrop of Napa Valley wine country.    After practicin
 g techniques to minimize drag and optimize stroke efficiency in the pool\,
  guests will refuel with an open-air lunch showcasing the freshest seasona
 l harvest from the ranch's own Grange gardens. Whether you're a competitiv
 e swimmer or simply seeking a one-of-a-kind wellness experience\, this int
 imate gathering at one of Napa's most coveted resort properties promises a
 n unforgettable Saturday morning.    The event takes place Saturday\, May 
 2\, 2026\, from 10:30 AM to 12:30 PM. Tickets are $85 per person and inclu
 de lunch. Open to both resort and non-resort guests. Advance reservations 
 are required — call 707.699.6260 or email stn.halehouse@auberge.com to r
 eserve your spot.
URL:https://www.winecountry.com/event/swim-with-an-olympian-at-stanly-ranc
 h/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
