UID:260218e6G0CTU1O0iKwTcCNzx16g
DESCRIPTION:Join Sonoma County Farm Trails for our Blossoms\, Bees & Barny
 ard Babies Spring Farm Tour on May 2 & 3\, 2026. This is a self-guided tou
 r of Farm Trails member farms\, ranches\, and producers. Choose your own a
 grarian adventure with farm tours\, farm animals\, special tastings and wo
 rkshops\, farm stands\, and more. All are welcome. Registration is FREE bu
 t required. Individual tour stops may require additional reservation or ch
 arge a fee. Full details will be provided via email.
LOCATION:Sonoma County Farm Trails
URL:https://www.farmtrails.org/experience/spring-tour-2/
