BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Clover Sonoma Family Fun Series: Ada Twist\, Scientist & Friends b
 y TheaterWorksUSA
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T153000
UID:260412IgTtm_10-EqtC6Cv5j7voA
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\nClover Sonoma Family Fun Series\n\nAda Tw
 ist\, Scientist & Friends\n\nby TheaterWorksUSA\n\nSunday\, May 3\, 2026\n
 \n3:30 pm\n\nBUY TICKETS \n\nIndividual Tickets go on sale for Members beg
 inning August 19\; General Public\, August 22 \n\n \n\nWhen Ms. Greer’s 
 classroom field trip goes awry\, three out-of-the-box thinkers must pull t
 heir STEM skills together to save the day! Meet Rosie Revere and her engin
 eering dreams\, Iggy Peck\, with her relentless passion for architecture\,
  and Ada Twist\, whose science curiosity leads her to some adventurous pro
 blem solving. In this live musical performance\, our heroes face the ultim
 ate test of their problem-solving skills—a test that can only be conquer
 ed through teamwork. Don’t miss this fun musical based on the Andrea Bea
 ty books\, Rosie Revere\, Engineer\; Iggy Peck\, Architect\, and Ada Twis
 t\, Scientist\, which spotlight the STEM curriculum \\(focusing on science
 \, technology\, engineering and math\\). \n\nRecommended for ages 5-9\, ho
 wever\, you know your child best. \n\nRun Time: 60 minutes \n\nLap passes 
 available day of the show\, in-person at the ticket office for ages 2 and 
 under. \n\nLBC performance may not include pieces from above video. \n\n \
 n\nFamily Fun in the Lobby\n\nStarting one hour before each performance\, 
 please join us in the lobby for fun art projects uniquely developed for ea
 ch show. It’s a fun\, free way for adults and children alike to get crea
 tive\, while enhancing your enjoyment of the show. We also have pizza\, be
 verages\, and snacks available\, all priced with a family’s budget in mi
 nd!   \n\nVIPs Meet the Cast\n\nSubscription holders be sure to stick aro
 und after the show to meet the cast and get autographs! \\(Except The Peki
 ng Acrobats®.\\) \n\n Family Fun Series – Save 20% and see all 5 shows!
 \n\nSee the full series here: Clover Sonoma Family Fun Series \n\nTimeline
 \n\nNew Subscriptions go on sale for Members beginning June 24\; General P
 ublic\, June 27.\n\nIndividual Tickets go on sale for Members beginning Au
 gust 19\; General Public\, August 22.\n\nTwo ways to buy! Season ticket pa
 ckages are available online or by downloading the form \\(linked below\\) 
 and sending the completed form to us by mail or email. If you have any que
 stions\, call the Patron & Member Services Office at 707.546.3600. \n\nPur
 chase New Subscription ONLINE\n\nDownload New Subscription Form \n\nTHIRD 
 PARTY RESELLERS\n\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use
  bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to p
 rotect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to
  work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box off
 ice in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are 
 easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer suppor
 t.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/4033312356914086/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
