 \, a rosé-inspired brunch set beneath the vineyard portico overlooking Wi
 ld Oak Vineyard and Hood Mountain. Surrounded by sunshine\, blooming vines
 \, and fresh spring air\, this whimsical gathering celebrates the best of 
 the season in Sonoma Valley. Guests will enjoy a family-style brunch thoug
 htfully prepared by Executive Chef Peter Janiak\, featuring vibrant\, seas
 onal dishes paired with an artisan selection of St. Francis wines-plus ple
 nty of rosé. A French chill playlist sets a relaxed yet celebratory mood\
 , perfect for lingering at the table. Whether you're planning a day with f
 riends\, celebrating an early Mother's Day\, hosting a bachelorette outing
 \, or enjoying a girls' day in Wine Country\, Brunch and Blush is an ideal
  way to sip\, savor\, and welcome spring.
