BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Uncorked for a Cause with Wiley's Wish and Mutt Lynch Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T190000
UID:2604173NmtO3PIs0WCJxIZoHomHg
DESCRIPTION:We’re putting together something really special — and it
 ’s all for the dogs 🤍\n\nWiley’s Wish\, Mutt Lynch Winery\, and Dog
  Moms of Sonoma County are coming together for a **fundraiser + silent au
 ction** we’re so excited about — **Uncorked for a Cause**.\n\n**Save
  the date: May 8th from 4–7pm**\n\nThis night is all about raising funds
  to continue the work behind Wiley’s Wish — rescuing\, training\, and 
 showing up every day for dogs who need a second chance.\n\nWe’re curatin
 g a really fun\, thoughtful **silent auction** (with some good surprises
  coming 👀)\, and every bid goes directly back to supporting the dogs in
  our care.\n\nAnd of course — there will be wine 🍷\, and some of our 
 incredible trained rescue dogs there to meet (the real stars of the show).
 \n\nIt’s an easy\, feel-good way to spend an evening while being part of
  something that truly matters. Join us!
LOCATION:Mutt Lynch Winery
URL:https://wileyswish.com/pages/news-events
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
