  The Big Easy Club and Restaurant 128 American Alley Petaluma USA\n\n\\*\\
 *\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\
 \*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\* Flamenco Shows every OTHER Month! The 2nd Saturday of
  the Month. Always different Artists. Always a different Show.\n\nFlamenco
  Dinner Show with delicious food and a Full Bar are available\, not includ
 ed in entrance fee.\n\nArrive early\, get a good table and enjoy the food!
  Line forms at 4:45 pm\n\n\\*Limited Reservations available for parties of
  5 - 6 or more. Call at: (707) 774- 9072\n\n\\*Large fully ventilated rest
 aurant\, plenty of room for spacing\, masks optional.\n\nFLAMENCO! LIVE! 
 ﻿was envisioned\, conceived\, and has thrived since 2002 in Sonoma Count
 y\, California\, now celebrating 24 years! Presenting the collaborative ef
 forts of the Bay Area's finest Flamenco Singers\, Guitarists and Dancers\,
  and supporting local Flamenco students\, dreamers\, and talents\, our goa
 l has been to present top-notch performances. Phoebe Vernier "La Fibi" has
  brought decades of artistry and energy to the public of Sonoma County for
  the purpose of sharing the music\, song and dance\, the treasure of South
 ern Spain. Whether in the formal theater or in a casual setting\, the resp
 ect\, purity\, and integrity of this traditional\, yet living and evolving
  art form is always foremost.\n\nNow in our 4rd Year of romantic Flamenco 
 Shows!\n\nThis performance is underwritten by the generous support of "The
  Circle of Sponsors"\, a group of flamenco music\, song and dance Aficiona
 dos from Sonoma County\, California and Nationwide that believe in the pow
 er of local art to heal and inspire our community and world. Thank you so 
 much\, Sponsors!\n\n"Best Performing Dance Company" - The Northbay Bohemia
 n's BEST of the Northbay!
LOCATION:The Big Easy Club and Restaurant
URL:https://flamencolive.weebly.com/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Making Lip Balm and Body Scrub with Anna O’Neil at Gold Ridge Or
 ganic Farms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T104500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T120000
UID:260419hPHsAwO_bkiY9KQLgkBA5g
DESCRIPTION:Join us in our charming Apple Cottage for a beautiful hands-on
  experience at Gold Ridge Organic Farms! Spend 75 minutes learning how to 
 craft your very own lip balm and body scrub using our organic olive oil\, 
 and discover how to select the right essential oils to make each creation 
 uniquely yours. Whether you're treating yourself or looking for a fun and 
 memorable way to celebrate Mother's Day with your mom\, this is the perfec
 t excuse to get creative together!\n\nThe experience includes a scenic rid
 e through the farm on our beloved apple-themed trolley and morning tea —
  plus every participant will take home two lip balms and a jar of their ve
 ry own body scrub as a personal keepsake from a truly special day.\n\nYour
  guide for the morning is Anna O'Neil\, an aromatherapist\, garden enthusi
 ast\, and aspiring folk herbalist with a deep-rooted passion for natural r
 emedies that promote well-being. Growing up in Northern California\, Anna 
 has been drawn to the healing power of nature since childhood\, crafting c
 ulinary creations\, herbal remedies\, and luxurious body products inspired
  by the seasonal bounty of the land. A Reiki and Yoga practitioner\, she i
 s dedicated to guiding others on their wellness journeys and helping them 
 discover what brings them comfort and joy.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/gold-ridge-organic-farms/event/605525/maki
 ng-lip-balm-and-body-scrub-with-anna-oneil
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
