 pm\, Saturday & Sunday matinee at 2:00pm\n\n\\* Saturday\, May 2nd at 2:00
 pm is a Pick-Your-Price Performance\, tickets are available on a sliding s
 cale starting at $10\n\nMusic by Stephen Flaherty\n\nLyrics by Lynn Ahrens
 \n\nBased on the Works of Theodor Geisel (Dr. Seuss)\n\nDirected by Kim Br
 omley\n\nMusic Direction by Lucas Sherman\n\nChoreography by Karen Miles\n
 \nFeaturing: Nelson Brown\, Monica Burrowes\, AJ Correia\, Sara Curtis\, A
 lex Delzell\, Katie Foster\, Mallory Gold\, Riz Gross\, Michael Hunter\, R
 on Lam\, Molly Larsen-Shine\, Addie Lowe\, Olivia Manz\, Michelle Pagano\,
  Orion Pudoff\, Peter Rogers\, Ted Smith\, Nicole Stanley\, Tina Traboulsi
 \, Malik Charles D. Wade I and Aliya Webb
