BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bobby Rush & North Mississippi Allstars
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T200000
UID:260129THKvx5EXA02PRTGNQhAfCA
DESCRIPTION:Modern Mississippi Hill Country band North Mississippi Allst
 ars and blues legend Bobby Rush are co-headlining this unique event\, w
 ith each artist performing separately before joining together to honor the
 ir Mississippi blues roots.\n\nNorth Mississippi Allstars was started by b
 rothers Luther and Cody Dickinson in 1996 as a loose collective of musicia
 ns from their North Mississippi home. They were inspired by their father J
 im Dickinson as well as neighbors and musical elders of their community\, 
 including RL Burnside\, Junior Kimbrough\, Otha Turner\, and Fred McDowell
 . They have multiple Grammy® nominations for their acclaimed experimenta
 l albums\, and the latest album\, Still Shakin’\, is out now.\n\nThe 9
 1-year-old Bobby Rush is a three-time Grammy Award® winner for “Best Tr
 aditional Blues Album” for Porcupine Meat\, Rawer than Raw\, and 2024
 ’s All My Love for You. He is also a 16-time Blues Music Awards winner 
 \\(with 56 career nominations\\) and has been inducted into the Blues Hall
  of Fame\, Mississippi Musicians Hall of Fame and Rhythm & Blues Hall of F
 ame.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/north-mississippi-allstars-bobby
 -rush26/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
