BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:12th Anniversary Party!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T130000
UID:260415RY0s1-OqHUaG0j-z0DjSkg
DESCRIPTION:It's our 12 year anniversary!  Mark your calendars and stay tu
 ned for even more exciting news this year ❤️ Kick off the SALUTE TO AM
 ERICAN GRAFFITI at Accu-Line Brake and Wheel! Free and open to the communi
 ty! Live music starts at 1pm! Complimentary refreshments and BBQ! Raffle P
 rizes-- all proceeds to benefit Petaluma High School Auto Shop program. If
  you would like to donate a raffle prize\,  please message us and we will 
 gladly promote your business and your generous gift to support the kids! C
 lassic car show-- bring your awesome pre-1975 classic car or truck-- no en
