BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Roustabout Theater's Apprentice Program Presents Cabaret
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T140000
UID:260412f1DsEKC7RE-LGRaDEwvL3w
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\nRoustabout Theater’s Apprentice Program
  Presents\n\nCabaret\n\nSaturday\, May 9\, 2026\, at 2:00 pm and 7:30 pm\n
 \nSunday\, May 10\, 2026\, at 2:00 pm\n\nBuy Tickets for May 9 at 2:00 pm\
 n\nBuy Tickets for May 9 at 7:30 pm\n\nBuy Tickets for May 10 at 2:00 pm \
 n\nWillkommen\, Bienvenue\, Welcome to Cabaret! It’s 1930 Berlin\, and 
 inside the Kit Kat Klub the delirious party rages on\, even as forces on t
 he outside gather strength. But what can Sally\, Cliff\, Kost\, Ludwig and
  the Emcee do about that? Come…Join Roustabout Theater’s Apprentice Pr
 ogram in our home in the Carston Cabaret as we dive into this carefree atm
 osphere with Kander and Ebb’s iconic score – including “Maybe This T
 ime”\, “Mein Herr”\, “Two Ladies”\, “Don’t Tell Mama”\, 
 “Cabaret” – and\, for the first time\, featuring two actors from Rou
 stabout’s Professional Ensemble: Bill Davis as Herr Schultz and and Lore
 tta Janka as Fraulein Schneider. This is a party you won’t soon forget. 
 Leave your troubles outside and…Welcome! \n\nRoustabout Theater is the l
 ongest running Resident Theater at the LBC offering both our Professional 
 Ensemble performances utilizing professional talent from across the Bay Ar
 ea and our award-winning Apprentice Program\, a leading training program f
 or actors and stage managers ages 11 – 20. \n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLER
 S\n\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy t
 ickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your pu
 rchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly
  with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa R
 osa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessi
 ble by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/roustabout-cabaret26/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Eco-Friendly Garden Tour in Sonoma
