DESCRIPTION:Celebrate spring at Imagery Estate Winery with a lively  Lawn 
 Party in the Sonoma sunshine. This family-friendly afternoon features live
  music from DJ Z\, spinning 80s hits\, classic rock\, and today's favorite
 s. Guests can enjoy local eats from Phat Salads and Wraps\, along with win
 e by the glass and refreshing frosé\, including a non-alcoholic option. L
 awn games and open space create a relaxed\, festive atmosphere perfect for
  gathering with friends and family. Admission is complimentary\, with food
  and wine available for purchase on a first-come\, first-served basis. Pic
 nic tables can be reserved for premium seating\, and leashed dogs are welc
 ome. It's an easygoing day of music\, food\, and wine in a beautiful winer
 y setting.
LOCATION:Imagery Estate Winery
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/lawn-party-at-imagery-estate-winery/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
